      "content": "but it's not just jarring. it's like i'm a ghost. i'm walking through the same streets and seeing the same things but the soul of it is just gone. everything is so hollow. i feel like i've already finished my part in this story, and now i'm just... lingering. it feels exhausting to keep trying to find a meaning that isn't there anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
